      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Pay attention to who gets upset by your visible happiness and keep them far away from you.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2039249745408135605",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-01T07:53:21+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Modern life is objectively easier and more comfortable than it was for 99% of human history, but at the same time, it's become harder to achieve some basic, important milestones.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2039327087149117711",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-01T13:00:41+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Taking everything you see on social media seriously is a great way to become mentally ill.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2038631202677256484",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-30T14:55:29+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "There are many things I don't don't bother debating because ultimately, time will prove who is correct.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2038599383516905964",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-30T12:49:03+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I went to church in Dubai yesterday (Palm Sunday) and the service was absolutely packed. Men, women, children, and noisy babies (including ours) from all over the world. \n\nEven with missles and drones flying overhead daily, people are keeping calm and carrying on. \ud83d\udc9c",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2038521494339534908",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-30T07:39:32+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "A new week begins. Grateful for the opportunities it will present.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2038515588046450833",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-30T07:16:04+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
